## Validation Checklist
1. `{{VALIDATE_COMMAND}}` passes (no type errors / syntax errors)
2. `{{PLAN_COMMAND}}` shows expected resources, no unintended replacements
3. All required config keys are set in `Pulumi.{env}.yaml` or as secrets
4. Stack references handle `None`/`undefined` for plan-time safety
5. No secrets or account IDs hardcoded in program code
6. New outputs exported from entry point match expected type
